==Trivia==
Haunter is one of seven Pokémon in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion featured in the "Touring the Kanto Region" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], in which all of the cards show various elements of the [[Kanto]] region. This card's illustration features the [[Pokémon Tower]] in [[Lavender Town]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Haunter}}.
*{{m|Will-O-Wisp}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Haunter}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

